## Verdict

The **MVP pipeline is substantially implemented**, and the two checked-in pilot results show generated tests distinguishing buggy from fixed revisions. **The full plan is not complete, and the project is not publication-ready yet.** The remaining gaps are mainly in benchmark breadth, running the frozen experiments, and validating the strength of the evaluation.

I treated the plan and `chat.md` as reference documents. The chat records earlier tests and smoke runs, but I did not rerun them for this review.

